":"香道部部長。 まじめで成績優秀。少々お堅い雰囲気を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもツンとしていて近寄りがたいが、突発的な出来事には弱く、あわあわしてしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度心を許すと依存しまくる隠れ甘えん坊タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拓真とは家庭教師として出会っており、初恋の人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貞操観念は非常に強いが、口はノーカン、お尻なら大丈夫 と、どんどんハードルが低くなっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私が部長の結城聖美です。 ……なんですか？ 人の顔をジロジロ見て。 私の顔に何か付いていますでしょうか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41573"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8234","sourceWorkId":"23418","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"157 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8234","sourceWorkId":"23418","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8234","sourceWorkId":"23418","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8234","sourceWorkId":"23418","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf160eb2e138ee6a0721969de60e57bfe35009309a7009210f0923d920558168.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a1f81659c108646c41e5139c0f3c7b9611264a3c9c139da2a0dba44c14facbd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:182379:41573:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c45141","characterName":"有森 つむぎ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41571","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"182379"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8233"],"vndbCharacterId":"c45141"},"originalCharacterName":"有森 つ